## Layout guidance when you edit this file:
##   * interior obstacles must sit inside 26..1254 across and 26..694 down,
##   * knight AABBs are 14px (16 for a warden, 34 for the Champion), so leave
##     40px+ between a patrol point and any wall - the test suite measures this
##     and will fail loudly,
##   * keep the player's `start` at least 14px clear of every wall,
##   * gates and hall mouths are 100px wide: anything narrower and the
##     flood-fill reachability check will call the space sealed,
##   * "braziers" are decoration only (no collision) - they are where the
##     torch light and the crowd colour live, so keep them off the routes.
